cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Patchbay, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Patchbay: Virtio I2C and SPI drivers for QNX, so QNX's sensor samples run without a board"
abstract: >-
  Virtio I2C and SPI master drivers for QNX 8.0, built on the QNX Driver Development Kit (libi2c-master and
  libio-spi), with a vhost-user back end that simulates a BNO055, an SHT3x and an MCP3008 from their data sheets and
  injects bus faults, so QNX's own sensor samples run unmodified in a QEMU guest.
authors:
  - family-names: Donovici
    given-names: Marc
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Marc-Dvci/Patchbay"
keywords:
  - QNX
  - device drivers
  - virtio
  - I2C
  - SPI
  - vhost-user
  - QEMU
  - fault injection
